            "paragraph": "The second Dynamics and Chemistry of Marine Stratocumulus (DYCOMS-II) experiment was held of the coast of California in July 2001 with the NCAR C130 (Stevens et al., 2003)... The Rain In Cumulus over the Ocean (RICO) field study... Among the three aircraft participating to the project, the NCAR C130 conducted semi-random cloud penetrations... The data examined here are from droplet spectrometers... the SPP-100, an electronically upgraded version of this instrument from Droplet Measurement Technologies (DMT) with 40 size classes... Table 1 indicates for each flight the aircraft type and the FSSP versions that were operated.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
